            "body": "> Vite+ exposes `vp` but no longer provides a standalone `oxlint` binary\r\n\r\nThis all sounds like gibberish to me. Is oxlint a separate project or is `oxlint` deprecated entirely? \r\n\r\nIf oxlint is a separate project, and \"vite\" was shipping `oxlint` as some sort of convenience, then it sounds like this change should be in a vite-specific config?",
