        {
            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "oxlint is the actual linter. vite+ embeds oxlint and some other tools to provide complete js/ts ecosystem tooling. when using vite+ you don't need to seperatly install oxlint as it is already embeded and exposed as the `vp lint` command. the problem is `oxlint` is then not in the `node_modules/.bin` and only `vp` is. so this pr makes lspconfig look for `vp` as well as `oxlint`.",
